              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "Extract the facts from this evidence item."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"a8e76d39fd03cb42aa852b5ded0aa310ffbd1caf226143517afc8443f34f1622\" kind=\"text\" label=\"delivery evidence\">\nFrom: Nemi Boro\nTo: Tavi Luren\nSubject: April bookkeeping handover\n\nThe April bank reconciliation is complete. All April bank transactions were reconciled against the supplied statement, and the reconciliation file is included with this handover.\n\nFiles listed for delivery:\nApril bank reconciliation worksheet\nApril balance sheet\nApril expense categorization worksheet\n\nThe expense worksheet categorizes 25 of the 40 April expense receipts. The remaining 15 receipts have not yet been categorized. The balance sheet is listed here, but its contents are not reproduced in this note.\n\nNo April profit and loss report was prepared or sent. Please review the reconciliation and let me know if any statement entries need clarification.\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
        }
